# Server-only Ethereum RPC endpoint. Used exclusively by the API routes
# (/api/now-playing, /api/plays) — never shipped to the browser.
# The key should be origin-restricted in the Infura/MetaMask Developer
# dashboard; the API routes send Origin: https://nftjukebox.app to match.
# Remember to set this same variable in Vercel's environment settings.
